comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T14:00:38.914Z","harness:codex","Evidence: changed only the unfiltered default contracts projection to summary-first while preserving scoped, runtime-only, explicit projections, and --full compatibility. Live size changed from 125,193 bytes to 11,413 bytes (about 91% smaller, about 2,854 estimated tokens); explicit full remains available. The bounded default includes intents, the core bootstrap flags, and declared output policy so a cold-start agent can route its next bounded call without per-command enumeration. Packed unrelated-consumer acceptance passed through the installed binary plus SDK subpath, npx --no-install, and bunx --bun. Linked tests passed 2/2; full repository coverage passed 6,413 tests at 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-07-27T14:07:54.754Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/774 at implementation head 8173f7f73. Exact-head hosted checks and bot review will follow after this PM evidence is committed."
  "2026-07-27T14:18:30.527Z","harness:codex","Hosted analysis correction for PR #774: DeepScan identified one unused contracts import. Removed it; static quality and focused contracts tests pass. No behavior or compatibility change was required."
  "2026-07-27T14:25:26.061Z","harness:codex","Second hosted correction for PR #774: removing the DeepScan import made one checked-in ESLint suppression obsolete. Pruned only that no-unused-vars suppression; the exact eslint gate now passes locally. DeepScan is 0 new / 1 fixed and the corrected smoke gate is green."
  "2026-07-27T14:59:27.994Z","harness:codex","Greptile review correction: contracts discovery now derives the ladder from the canonical SDK constant and uses explicit per-command bootstrap flags that prioritize pagination, token bounds, and routing rather than positional truncation. The public authoring helper now rejects non-positive, fractional, and non-finite token ceilings. Focused SDK/contracts/ratchet tests pass 65/65; ESLint, static quality, SDK snapshot, token budget, and 95-surface ratchet pass."
